  "body": "Just now it seems, that the only format which can contain more than 8 bits is TIFF, so i have to convert my Sony A7CR HIF-Pictures (10 bit) to 16bit TIFF to work with them in ART.\n\nOther format like JXL and PNG are not recognized in the album view.\n\nFor sure, TIFF is a workaround, but the file sizes are huge ...\n\nThank you",
